# CVEs in Firecrawl's npm and Go dependencies that cannot be patched from
# a Dockerfile layer — they require Firecrawl to update their lockfile and
# release a new upstream image. Remove entries when the upstream image ships
# the fixed package versions.
#
# All are DoS-class vulnerabilities in internal tooling (not data exfiltration).
# Risk accepted for dev environment; re-evaluate before promoting to prod.

